  "details": "The current name for Ukrainian in the user languages profile section is taken from an outside source. This is made apparent because the string starts with a lowercase character and, most importantly, includes a combining acute symbol above the stressed syllable, which is never used in normal text.\n\nFixing this is straightforward: replace the current language name [украї́нська] with a corrected one [Українська]. Exclude the square brackets.",
